# proto-file: legged_nmpc/legged_multi_contact/plan/multi_contact_plan.proto
# proto-message: legged_multi_contact.MultiContactPlan
# A hand-written plan for the box_climb scenario, for the tests of the certifier and of the plan playback: Atlas
# stands on both feet in front of the box and sways its base 6 cm forward and back in one second. Every knot is
# statically stable with the scenario's 3 cm margin and its momentum rate (about 40 N) lies in the contact wrench
# cone. The hashes are those of Atlas's contact set and of box_climb's scene: the test that loads this file names
# the hashes to write here when either changes.

